the most effective form of vitamin K known as menaquinone-7. Just one Super Booster provides:\n~Gamma Tocopherol- if one consumes only alpha tocopherol, the critically important gamma tocopherol is displaced from cells within the body. 115 While alpha tocopherols vitamin E suppressed lipid peroxidation, the gamma tocopherol form quenches thes peroxynitrite free radical. It is especially important for those who take vitamin E supplements to make sure they consume at least 200 mg of gamma tocopherol daily.\n~ Sesame Lignans-Sesame lignans augment the antioxidant effects of both alpha and gamma tocopherol. In a human study, gamma tocopherol plus sesame seed lignans were 25% more effective in suppressing measurements of free-radical damage than gamma tocopherol and tocotrienols. 116-118\n~ Vitamin K-Vitamin K1 from dietary plant sources is poorly absorbed and only a small fraction gets into the bloodstream. Vitamin K2 is absorbed much more efficiently. Scientific studies show K2 provides superior benefits for the bones, arteries, and other tissues. The MK-4 form of vitamin K2 is the most rapidly absorbed and is now routinely used in Japan to maintain healthy bone density. MK-4, however, only remains active in the blood for a few hours. The MK-7 form of K2, on the other  hand, remains bioavailable to the human body over a sustained 24-hour period. Super Booster now provides a potent dose of MK-7 to keep calcium in the bone and out of the arteries, along with Mk-4 and vitamin K1.\n~ Lycopene-Evidence suggests that people who ingest the carotenoid lycopene enjoy healthier prostate function. 119,120 Lycopene also helps guard against LDL oxidation. 84,121\n~ Lutein-The carotenoid lutein helps maintain healthy cell division, supports the macula of they eye, and protects the endothelial lining of the arteries. 122-127\n~ Ginkgo-Hundreds of studies indicate the multifaceted effects of GInkgo biloba in promoting healthy circulatory and neurological function. 128.129\n~ Chlorophyllin -Scientific studies indicate that chlorophyllin may be the most potent nutrient to protect against environmentally induced damage to DNA. 130-132"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The Super Booster saves consumers huge dollars by combining a wide variety of costly nutrients into one daily softgel. If you ad up the price of the individual ingredients contained in the Super Booster, you would spend two-to-three times more for this potency if taken separately."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warnings\n~ Keep out of reach of children"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"~ Do not exceed recommended dose\n~ Do not purchase if outer seal is broken or damaged."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"All contents copyright (C) 1995-2013 Life Extension(R) All Rights Reserved"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"The information provided on this site is for informational purposes only and is not intended as a substitute for advice from your physician or other health care professional or any information contained on or in any product label or packaging. You should not use the information on this site for diagnosis or treatment of any health problem or for prescription of any medication or other treatment. You should consult with a healthcare professional before starting any diet, exercise or supplementation program, before taking any medication, or if you have or suspect you might have a health problem. You should not stop taking any medication without first consulting your physician."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains soybeans."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Tomat-O-Red(R) is a 